## Nektos/ACT
# Nektos/ACT Files Igore Pattern

# Nektos/act scratch state. `mise run act` writes a live `gh auth token` into
# .act/.secrets, so nothing in here may be committed -- only the README, which
# says exactly that.
.act/*
!.act/README.md

